<title>USA: SQUASH-TOURNAMENT OF CHAMPIONS QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-TOURNAMENT OF CHAMPIONS QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>Tournament of Champions on Saturday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Anthony Hill (Australia) 15-10</p>
<p>15-11 15-6</p>
<p>4-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat Mark Chaloner (England) 8-15 15-5</p>
<p>15-13 15-10</p>
<p>Jonathan Power (Canada) beat 2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) 15-7</p>
<p>17-15 15-9</p>
<p>Craig Rowland (Australia) beat Simon Parke (England) 9-15 15-10</p>
<p>9-15 15-9 15-13</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>1-Michelle Martin (Australia) beat 5-Carol Owens (Australia)</p>
<p>5-9 9-3 9-2 9-6</p>
<p>3-Cassie Jackman (England) beat 8-Claire Nitch (South Africa)</p>
<p>9-7 9-2 9-3</p>
<p>4-Liz Irving (Australiaq) beat 7-Fiona Geaves (England) 9-6 9-4</p>
<p>9-1</p>
<p>2-Suzanne Horner (England) beat 6-Sabine Schoene (Germany) 9-7</p>
<p>9-6 6-9 10-9</p>
</text>
